    <panel_attributes>title=SD03 - Modify Meal Plan Using Natural Language   (UC08; F06, F07, F09, F10, F11, F12)\nGUI calls reach the facade through MealPlanningApi (HTTP, as in SD01), the CLI calls it in-process
obj=Meal Planner~U ACTOR
obj=:MealPlanningGUI~GUI
obj=:MealPlanningFacade~F
obj=:AgentController~AC
obj=:ConversationMemory~MEM
obj=:MealPlanningAgent~AG
obj=:PromptBuilder~PB
obj=:ProviderLLMAdapter\n«LLMClient»~LLM
obj=External LLM API\n«external»~EXT
obj=:ProposalValidator~PV
obj=:ConstraintValidator~CV
obj=:MealPlanService~MPS
obj=cmd:\nReplaceMealCommand~CMD
obj=plan:MealPlan~MP
obj=:MealPlanRepository~MPR
obj=:GroceryService~GS

U-&gt;&gt;&gt;GUI : 1: "Make Wednesday's\ndinner vegetarian"
GUI-&gt;&gt;&gt;F : 2: modifyPlan(planId,\ninstruction); on=F
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;MPS : 3: getPlan(planId); on=MPS
MPS.&gt;F : 4: plan; off=MPS
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;AC : 5: interpretModification(plan,\ninstruction); on=AC
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;AC + : 6:\nbuildContext(\nrequest)
tick=1
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;AG : 7: proposeChange(context, instruction); on=AG
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;MEM : 8: retrieveRelevantContext(\nprofileId, instruction); on=MEM
MEM.&gt;AG : 9: prior confirmed decisions; off=MEM
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;PB : 10: buildChangePrompt(\ncontext, instruction); on=PB
PB.&gt;AG : 11: prompt; off=PB
combinedFragment=loop~R AG EXT; PB:[until schema-valid output, max 2 attempts]
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;LLM : 12: generateStructured(prompt, PlanChange schema); on=LLM
LLM-&gt;&gt;&gt;EXT : 13: createStructuredResponse(\nrequest); on=EXT
EXT.&gt;LLM : 14: response, or timeout /\nprovider error; off=EXT
LLM.&gt;AG : 15: change data, or LLMError (mapProviderError); off=LLM
--=R
AG.&gt;AC : 16: PlanChange (target meals, REPLACE_MEAL, rationale); off=AG
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;PV : 17: validate(change, context); on=PV
PV.&gt;AC : 18: ValidationResult; off=PV
combinedFragment=alt~A1 GUI CV; F:[target ambiguous]
AC.&gt;F : 19: AgentResponse(\nNEEDS_CLARIFICATION,\nquestion)
..=A1; F:[provider failed or change infeasible]
AC.&gt;F : 20: AgentResponse(FAILED\nor CONFLICT, alternatives)
..=A1; F:[valid]
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;CV : 21: validateChange(change, context); on=CV
text=CV:checks via\nvalidateRestrictions()\nand validateTime()
CV.&gt;AC : 22: ValidationResult; off=CV
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;AC + : 23:\nhold inpending\nChanges
tick=1
AC.&gt;F : 24: AgentResponse(\nNEEDS_CONFIRMATION,\nchange); off=AC
--=A1
F.&gt;GUI : 25: AgentResponse; off=F
GUI.&gt;U : 26: preview, clarification\nquestion, or alternatives
combinedFragment=alt~A2 U GS; GUI:[user confirms]
U-&gt;&gt;&gt;GUI : 27: Confirm
GUI-&gt;&gt;&gt;F : 28: executeChange(planId,\nchange); on=F
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;AC : 29: confirmChange(planId,\nchange); on=AC
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;MPS : 30: executeChange(planId, change); on=MPS
MPS-&gt;&gt;&gt;MPS + : 31:\ncreateCommand(\nchange)
tick=1
MPS-&gt;&gt;&gt;CMD : 32: execute(plan); on=CMD
CMD-&gt;&gt;&gt;MP : 33: replaceMeal(mealId,\nrecipe)
CMD.&gt;MPS : 34: previous recipe kept for\nundo(); off=CMD
MPS-&gt;&gt;&gt;MPR : 35: save(plan)
MPS.&gt;AC : 36: updated MealPlan; off=MPS
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;MEM : 37: recordDecision(profileId,\ndecision)
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;GS : 38: refreshForPlan(plan); on=GS
GS.&gt;AC : 39: refreshed GroceryList; off=GS
AC.&gt;F : 40: AgentResponse(SUCCESS,\nplan, groceryList); off=AC
F.&gt;GUI : 41: AgentResponse; off=F
GUI.&gt;U : 42: updated plan, nutrition,\nand grocery list
..=A2; GUI:[user cancels]
text=GUI:no command is executed,\nthe active plan is unchanged
--=A2</panel_attributes>
